{"id":5116,"date":"2021-11-29T09:00:42","date_gmt":"2021-11-29T17:00:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/penserra.com\/?page_id=5116"},"modified":"2022-02-10T08:21:54","modified_gmt":"2022-02-10T16:21:54","slug":"sustainability","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/penserra.com\/sustainability\/","title":{"rendered":"Sustainability"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-nk-awb nk-awb alignfull nk-awb-fullheight nk-awb-content-valign-bottom nk-awb-Z2ucXyx\" data-ghostkit-styles=\".nk-awb-Z2ucXyx { margin-bottom: 80px; }\"><div class=\"nk-awb-wrap\" data-awb-type=\"image\" data-awb-image-background-size=\"cover\" data-awb-image-background-position=\"54% 71%\" data-awb-parallax=\"scroll\" data-awb-parallax-speed=\"0.8\" data-awb-parallax-mobile=\"true\"><div class=\"nk-awb-overlay\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.44);\"><\/div><div class=\"nk-awb-inner\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-scaled.jpg\" class=\"wp-image-5118 jarallax-img is-layout-constrained wp-block-awb-is-layout-constrained lazyload\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1709\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-500x334.jpg 500w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-768x513.jpg 768w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-2048x1367.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-800x534.jpg 800w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-1280x854.jpg 1280w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted040-1920x1282.jpg 1920w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 2560px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 2560\/1709;\" \/><\/div><\/div>\n<h1 class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color wp-block-heading\" id=\"sustainability\">Sustainability<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"taking-care-of-this-planet\">Taking Care of This Planet<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Sustainability is most often defined as meeting the needs of the present without compromising the ability of future generations to meet theirs. It has three main pillars:\u00a0<strong>economic, environmental, and social<\/strong>. These three pillars are informally referred to as people, planet, and profits.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"mission-statement\"><strong>Mission Statement<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Penserra is dedicated to continuous improvement in the understanding of the relationships between human activities and the environment. We are committed to providing practical solutions in support of a strong economy and industrial progress, based on the principles of sustainable use of Earth&#8217;s resources and maintenance of a safe and healthy environment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/One-Tree-Planted-horizontal-logo.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5153 lazyload\" width=\"310\" height=\"71\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 310px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 310\/71;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The Penserra Foundation established a partnership with One Tree Planted, a nonprofit organization focused on advancing the United Nations\u2019 17 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) through global reforestation initiatives. In recognition of Penserra\u2019s commitment to sustainability, the foundation and One Tree Planted will collaborate on tree planting engagements throughout California and Illinois.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote alignleft\"><blockquote><p>&#8220;Penserra strongly believes in preserving our planet and offsetting our carbon footprint.&#8221;<\/p><cite>Jorge Madrigal, CEO<\/cite><\/blockquote><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>One Tree Planted is focused on the six pillars of global reforestation- air, water, biodiversity, social impact, health, and climate. Planting trees is one of the best ways to combat the damaging effects of climate change. Trees also provide tremendous social impacts by providing jobs to over 1.6 billion people, empowering women in underdeveloped nations, and supporting communities devastated by environmental damage.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This partnership aligns with Penserra\u2019s approach to a sustainable infrastructure. By thinking and acting with a goal of sustainability, Penserra will be positioned for a strong future. Sustainability is a business method that ensures responsibility in a manner that protects our employees, communities, stakeholders, and the environment, now and in the future.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/3.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5152 lazyload\" width=\"408\" height=\"408\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/3.png 800w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/3-500x500.png 500w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/3-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/3-768x768.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaG